  "description": {
    "en": "A quiet dot under the conversation header that unfolds into the Chinese solar term, the day pillar and double-hour, its 候, a 养生 line, the year table and the 消息卦 of the month. Drag the card itself; tap the day pillar for a short reading; the 卦 page casts a hexagram with three coins and keeps the last seven days.",
    "zh": "对话区标题栏下沿的一颗小圆点，展开是今天的节气、日柱时辰、三候、一句养生、全年交节时刻与月建消息卦；整张卡片都能拖着走，点日柱看今天适合做的事，卦页还能铜钱摇一卦并回看七天。"
  },
