      "description": {
        "en": "Yueling (月令) — a solar-term dot for the DeepSeek Harness Web GUI. Local astronomy: today's term, day pillar and double-hour, 72 pentads, the month's sovereign hexagram, a 养生 line, the year table, a day reading page, and a three-coin hexagram cast with a seven-day log. No network, no sidebar slot. Install from the Plugins page: dshjieqi-card (npm) or github:SDSAEWQ/yueling",
        "zh": "月令：二十四节气卡片。干支年、月建、日柱时辰、三候、消息卦、年表、养生一句与三伏数九，全部本地计算；点日柱看今天适合做的事，卦页还能铜钱摇一卦并回看七天。安装：插件页「添加插件」填 dshjieqi-card（npm）或 github:SDSAEWQ/yueling"
      },
